<description>&lt;p&gt;Drone strikes continue in the disputed Abyei border region, with Sudanese forces attacking markets and killing dozens of civilians while Sudan denies involvement and blames the RSF. Communal clashes between SSPDF and SPLA-IO forces have escalated in Lakes state, resulting in about 70 deaths, and police in Juba have arrested 43 members of the Lologo gang and investigated the killing of a central bank worker. The UN envoy has urged South Sudan leaders to choose consensus over confrontation, and Uganda has defended its military deployment in the country. The UCDP recorded two battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE1Zc0dVWGU2SlJTeDhZYk12X1ZGWGpGVzJVYVFEckpRMjk4clY0SDZobE4zLU5oMzhoQXRXSWFUX2xyLVVfRFlyVGFVb2ctTVdmWHY3aE4wVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNTkZja2JVNUJZenJ5Wlg3cEVkWVkzQkZvSmN5WmVoOXUwVG5kbW0zcExRdHIwYm5NWDJhNDlOcXpnWGpxZm5RbDJrU2hxTFVRVzJCZGVnYW1MVVFDU0tmZHB6S2tRWFNObWZSa0tQNnphSjJseWM4X3BrSDR0b0F6Vlp4OVU1aUJBNXVZaG1uZzZnWDY4d3VqNl9NbTUzeUxraUktMkNxbDVibTd0bTJ6cnVR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE9JM0dVb2dqdDMxYkw1alJIOWRHQmJDSWE3T3VUOS1mOThGY2ZReW9fU2lrM096ZktDcFpXMlFrWEJ1UFJ4OHpWN3ByWW1oVjNi?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPT2EtVjNuVEszeE1FZEVSVl9FZXhra1ZxZ0JFSFVacTZBX2JlZmJFQzRSdHdsMmdOblp3M1duVXAtU29DVm1oY19tQUJpSWx5TXlJY2JSSzBxZ0V1TDdtclg3WmlvMVpRZmlVUGRaTFJnb0tPYjJBT2syNkduS3FjMjRQTnUyTXl4SzBteDhLdHFIdjQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;htt